1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Esteban was captain of the provincial militias and chief of the second branch of the House of Llarena of the Canary Islands, the House of Mesa, and possessor of the Majorat of Xuárez-Tello y Van de Walle. His grand
2 CONC parents were the second Marquises of Acialcazar.
2 CONT
2 CONT On May 30, 1745 he married Ana-Teresa Falcon, daughter of Captain Ventura-Isidro Falcón y Navarro (Landlord of the majorat of his house and a perpetual governor of the island of Gran Canaria) and Mrs. Teresa-Antonia Ramos Bravo de
2 CONC  Laguna Collado y Van Damme, both noted by Peraza de Ayala as belonging to a "distinguished family lineage".
